;padding:1px 8px\">Mac 标配</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 16px 10px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">高级前端工程师</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">北京 · 全职 · 30-50K</div></div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px\">投递</button>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">AI 产品经理</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">上海 · 全职 · 25-45K</div></div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px\">投递</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:13px 16px 9px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-top:5px\">阿梨</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">独立开发者 · 用 AI 做小而美的工具</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:0 16px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:280px;margin:0 auto\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)\">📝 我的博客 <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-weight:400\">· 每周更新</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;paddi